{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100% Physics-Driven Scooter Simulation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the first scooter game where everything\u2014from the wheels to the rider\u2019s head\u2014is powered by physics. Trick buttons trigger animations, but all movement is driven by a real physics system underneath. Every grind, whip, and slam reacts the way it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load into a map and start riding. Find lines, try tricks, and session spots your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef4 100% physics-driven movement\u2014no fakes, no shortcuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Every part of the rider and scooter reacts with physical accuracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef9 A mix of skateparks and street spots to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d Mod.io integration for community maps and content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Focused on flow, experimentation, and progression through play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no wrong way to ride. Just drop in and see what you can pull off.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800340?t=1752877058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800340?t=1752877058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800340/bd99f93e192cccaeadc130551e621712cdef8cdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752877058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800340/bd99f93e192cccaeadc130551e621712cdef8cdf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752877058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"co